    "description": "Fits second-order autoregressive AR(2) models to gene expression time series and reports the eigenvalue modulus |lambda|, a single statistic quantifying temporal persistence: how strongly a gene's recent past constrains its next value. Ranks genes into a clock/target/background hierarchy and reports correlation length, half-life and root type (real or complex) per gene.",
